  "body": "```\r\n(synapse) user@server:/opt/synapse $ register_new_matrix_user\r\n  File \"/opt/synapse/bin/register_new_matrix_user\", line 45\r\n    print \"ERROR! Received %d %s\" % (e.code, e.reason,)\r\n                                ^\r\nSyntaxError: invalid syntax\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n(synapse) user@server:/opt/synapse $ python2.7 bin/register_new_matrix_user \r\nusage: register_new_matrix_user [-h] [-u USER] [-p PASSWORD] [-a | --no-admin]\r\n                                (-c CONFIG | -k SHARED_SECRET)\r\n                                [server_url]\r\nregister_new_matrix_user: error: one of the arguments -c/--config -k/--shared-secret is required\r\n```",
